                      "query": "Use the skill-testing skill to test the Valkey GLIDE skill at /home/jonathan/Work/Repos/AWS/Valkey-Samples/skills/glide for Java language. Create 2 test cases specifically for TLS and authentication: 1) Connect to a Valkey cluster with TLS enabled and password authentication, 2) Connect with TLS using both username and password. Save results to glide-workspace/java-tls-auth-test/",
