                      "query": "Use the skill-testing skill to test the Valkey GLIDE skill at /home/jonathan/Work/Repos/AWS/Valkey-Samples/skills/glide for Python language. Create 2 test cases specifically for TLS and authentication: 1) Parse a valkeyss:// URL with password and create client with TLS, 2) Parse a valkeyss:// URL with username and password. Save results to glide-workspace/python-tls-auth-test/",
