    "Based on the skill-creator methodology and our validation results, let me apply the key insight: **\"Explain the why\"** and **\"Lead with examples, not warnings\"**. The skill-creator guide says:\n\n> \"Try hard to explain the **why** behind everything you're asking the model to do. Today's LLMs are *smart*. They have good theory of mind and when given a good harness can go beyond rote instructions and really make things happen.\"\n\nLet me restructure the Python FT API document to lead with examples and explain the why:\n[Tool uses: fs_write]",
