    "Excellent! All file references are valid. Let me create a summary:\n\n## ✅ All Links Verified - Commit 0f5c341 is Good\n\nAll simplified markdown links in commit `0f5c341` are functional and point to the correct files:\n\n### Python (references/python.md)\n- ✅ `python-ft-api.md`\n- ✅ `python-package-selection.md`\n- ✅ `python-parse-valkey-urls.md`\n- ✅ `python-decode-docs.md`\n- ✅ `python-anti-patterns.md`\n- ✅ `../assets/python-config.py`\n- ✅ `../assets/python-create-index.py`\n- ✅ `../assets/python-batch-sync.py`\n- ✅ `../assets/python-batch-async.py`\n- ✅ `../assets/python-error-handling.py`\n\n### Other Languages\n- ✅ Java: `java-package-selection.md`, `java-anti-patterns.md`, `../assets/java-config.java`\n- ✅ Go: `go-package-selection.md`, `go-anti-patterns.md`, `../assets/go-config.go`\n- ✅ C#: `csharp-anti-patterns.md`, `../assets/csharp-config.cs`\n- ✅ Node.js: `nodejs-anti-patterns.md`\n- ✅ PHP: `php-anti-patterns.md`, `../assets/php-config.php`\n\n### Shared\n- ✅ `server-configuration-guide.md` (referenced from all languages)\n\n**All links are relative to the correct directory and all target files exist.** The simplification successfully reduced token count without breaking any references.\n[Tool uses: none]",
